{"seq":3,"slug":"flaky-tests","title":"Flaky 测试治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/flaky-tests","wordCount":849,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"flaky-测试治理\">Flaky 测试治理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Flaky 测试（不稳定测试）是 CI 系统的癌症——它们在相同代码上时而通过、时而失败，没有确定性。当 CI 中有 5% 的 flaky 测试时，开发者开始习惯性地点击&quot;重试&quot;；当达到 15% 时，CI 的信任度崩塌，团队开始忽略失败的测试。Google 的工程实践报告显示，大型代码库中 flaky 测试占所有测试失败的 <strong>84%</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[测试失败] --&gt; B{是否 Flaky?}&#10;    B --&gt;|相同代码多次运行| C[分析失败模式]&#10;    C --&gt; D{根因分类}&#10;    D --&gt; E[时序依赖]&#10;    D --&gt; F[资源竞争]&#10;    D --&gt; G[外部服务]&#10;    D --&gt; H[环境差异]&#10;    E --&gt; I[修复策略]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[验证稳定性]&#10;    J --&gt; K[解除隔离]\">graph TD\n    A[测试失败] --&gt; B{是否 Flaky?}\n    B --&gt;|相同代码多次运行| C[分析失败模式]\n    C --&gt; D{根因分类}\n    D --&gt; E[时序依赖]\n    D --&gt; F[资源竞争]\n    D --&gt; G[外部服务]\n    D --&gt; H[环境差异]\n    E --&gt; I[修复策略]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[验证稳定性]\n    J --&gt; K[解除隔离]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Flaky 根因</th>\n<th>占比</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n<th>修复难度</th>\n<th>防护措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序/竞态</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>异步操作未等待</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>显式等待、确定性时钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享状态</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>测试间数据污染</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>测试隔离、独立数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部依赖</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>API 超时/不可用</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Mock/VCR 录制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境差异</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>本地通过 CI 失败</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>容器化测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源限制</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>内存/CPU 不足</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>资源调整、降低并行度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"检测与识别\">检测与识别</h2><p>检测 flaky 测试的第一步是<strong>区分&quot;真失败&quot;和&quot;不稳定失败&quot;</strong>。最简单的方法是对失败的测试自动重试——如果重试通过，就标记为 flaky。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;&#10;      - name: Run tests with retry&#10;        run: pnpm vitest --run --reporter=json --outputFile=results.json&#10;        continue-on-error: true&#10;&#10;      - name: Retry failed tests&#10;        if: steps.test.outcome == &#39;failure&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          FAILED=$(jq -r &#39;.testResults[] | select(.status == &quot;failed&quot;) | .name&#39; results.json)&#10;          echo &quot;$FAILED&quot; | xargs pnpm vitest --run\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./.github/actions/setup-pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run tests with retry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm vitest --run --reporter=json --outputFile=results.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        continue-on-error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Retry failed tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">steps.test.outcome == 'failure'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          FAILED=$(jq -r '.testResults[] | select(.status == \"failed\") | .name' results.json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"$FAILED\" | xargs pnpm vitest --run</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更系统化的方法是维护一个 <strong>flaky 测试数据库</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FlakyRecord {&#10;  testId: string;&#10;  testFile: string;&#10;  testName: string;&#10;  firstSeen: Date;&#10;  lastSeen: Date;&#10;  totalRuns: number;&#10;  failureCount: number;&#10;  flakyRate: number;&#10;  status: &#39;active&#39; | &#39;quarantined&#39; | &#39;resolved&#39;;&#10;  assignee?: string;&#10;  rootCause?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const detectFlaky = (testResults: TestResult[], history: FlakyRecord[]): FlakyRecord[] =&gt; {&#10;  const newFlaky: FlakyRecord[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const result of testResults) {&#10;    if (result.status === &#39;failed&#39; &amp;&amp; result.retryStatus === &#39;passed&#39;) {&#10;      const existing = history.find((r) =&gt; r.testId === result.id);&#10;      if (existing) {&#10;        existing.failureCount++;&#10;        existing.totalRuns++;&#10;        existing.lastSeen = new Date();&#10;        existing.flakyRate = existing.failureCount / existing.totalRuns;&#10;      } else {&#10;        newFlaky.push({&#10;          testId: result.id,&#10;          testFile: result.file,&#10;          testName: result.name,&#10;          firstSeen: new Date(),&#10;          lastSeen: new Date(),&#10;          totalRuns: 1,&#10;          failureCount: 1,&#10;          flakyRate: 1,&#10;          status: &#39;active&#39;,&#10;        });&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return newFlaky;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FlakyRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  testId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  testFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  testName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  firstSeen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastSeen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalRuns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  failureCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  flakyRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'quarantined'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'resolved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  assignee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rootCause</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> detectFlaky</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">testResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FlakyRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FlakyRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newFlaky</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FlakyRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> testResults) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.retryStatus </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'passed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark